* PVCELL port-A terminal short, 3 cells, bank 1100 V, clamp 6 x WND75P16W6, per-cell equivalent of the shared loop. Generated by sim/pv_design.py
.model dbody D(Is=4.014e-05 N=10.28 Rs=0.01567 Cjo=1.049e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5)
.model dcl D(Is=5.79e-11 N=1.16 Rs=0.0005167 Cjo=1.8e-09 Vj=0.7 M=0.5)
C1 c1 0 9e-05 ic=1100.0
Lesl c1 c2 9.5e-09
Resr c2 bp 0.00155
Lm bp m1 1.5e-06
Rm m1 0 0.005207812500000001
Vsl 0 lx 0
Dlo lx l2 dbody m=2
